# program: ../apps/code-studio/src/main.nx
# env PATH=/usr/bin:/bin
# nexac isn't installed: editing works, and the window says what's missing.
window Code Studio
key ctrl+n
until Code Studio needs nexac
shot no-nexac
key ctrl+shift+F12
key ctrl+shift+f
key ctrl+shift+F12
key ctrl+q
window Close without saving\?
key Return
